---

exec?

without exec
    bash = PID 1
    mysqld = child process

    - Signals break.
    - Zombie processes possible.
    - Improper shutdowns possible.
  
with exec:
    mysqld replaces bash
    mysqld becomes PID 1

    This is proper container lifecycle design.
